{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement revolves around <strong>building and keeping momentum.</strong> High speed lets you run on any surface: walls, ceilings, loops. Mastering the move set lets you do <i>basically anything.</i> <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354950/extras/8d1ab2e404b3db77d53a431628b2d700.poster.avif?t=1772190741\" width=780 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354950/extras/8d1ab2e404b3db77d53a431628b2d700.webm?t=1772190741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354950/extras/8d1ab2e404b3db77d53a431628b2d700.mp4?t=1772190741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abilities revolve around movement. Your signature move lets you <strong>jump/dash in any direction</strong>, while others let you reverse and even store your momentum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354950/extras/911d7fd21a3eb8aea42752a246d41b9a.poster.avif?t=1772190741\" width=1170 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354950/extras/911d7fd21a3eb8aea42752a246d41b9a.webm?t=1772190741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354950/extras/911d7fd21a3eb8aea42752a246d41b9a.mp4?t=1772190741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You only have 10 minutes to work with, but can rewind the entire map to any point in time. Solve puzzles by going down one-way paths, making temporally persistent changes, then rewinding. Unlock shortcuts, go fast and manage your limited time.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354950/extras/4034867a280f4ffeccf39741cba7a037.poster.avif?t=1772190741\" width=780 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354950/extras/4034867a280f4ffeccf39741cba7a037.webm?t=1772190741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354950/extras/4034867a280f4ffeccf39741cba7a037.mp4?t=1772190741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354950/extras/5df27c6e65aadcdd435de2da5abd3fea.poster.avif?t=1772190741\" width=1170 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354950/extras/5df27c6e65aadcdd435de2da5abd3fea.webm?t=1772190741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354950/extras/5df27c6e65aadcdd435de2da5abd3fea.mp4?t=1772190741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement and combat are one and the same as <strong>damage scales with speed.</strong> You're fragile but also immune to kinetic damage, so collide with enemies and obstacles head on to destroy them.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354950/extras/61ce295bc4dc37e039e1336b76ac97d1.poster.avif?t=1772190741\" width=780 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354950/extras/61ce295bc4dc37e039e1336b76ac97d1.webm?t=1772190741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354950/extras/61ce295bc4dc37e039e1336b76ac97d1.mp4?t=1772190741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354950/extras/f5fee27a04bc0739924b004696d460e9.poster.avif?t=1772190741\" width=1170 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354950/extras/f5fee27a04bc0739924b004696d460e9.webm?t=1772190741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354950/extras/f5fee27a04bc0739924b004696d460e9.mp4?t=1772190741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's not clear why the facility is going haywire or what happened to all the people. The retro-futuristic setting is inspired by the Cold War era which should give you some idea. For those who are done with the story, you can activate &quot;speedrunner mode&quot; to skip cutscenes and time your run.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354950/extras/3955f560d4979341d5e3f43fae8d14fd.poster.avif?t=1772190741\" width=780 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354950/extras/3955f560d4979341d5e3f43fae8d14fd.webm?t=1772190741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354950/extras/3955f560d4979341d5e3f43fae8d14fd.mp4?t=1772190741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3354950?t=1772190741","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3354950?t=1772190741","capsule_image":"