e, so collide with enemies and obstacles head on to destroy them.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354950/extras/61ce295bc4dc37e039e1336b76ac97d1.poster.avif?t=1772190741\" width=780 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354950/extras/61ce295bc4dc37e039e1336b76ac97d1.webm?t=1772190741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354950/extras/61ce295bc4dc37e039e1336b76ac97d1.mp4?t=1772190741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354950/extras/f5fee27a04bc0739924b004696d460e9.poster.avif?t=1772190741\" width=1170 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354950/extras/f5fee27a04bc0739924b004696d460e9.webm?t=1772190741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354950/extras/f5fee27a04bc0739924b004696d460e9.mp4?t=1772190741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's not clear why the facility is going haywire or what happened to all the people. The retro-futuristic setting is inspired by the Cold War era which should give you some idea. For those who are done with the story, you can activate &quot;speedrunner mode&quot; to skip cutscenes and time your run.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354950/extras/3955f560d4979341d5e3f43fae8d14fd.poster.avif?t=1772190741\" width=780 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.s